SUMMARY:Belles and Chimes Pinball Tournament
DTSTAMP:20260707T043923Z
DTSTART:20260711T130000Z
DESCRIPTION:Belles & Chimes is an international network of women’s pinball 
	leagues. The Houston chapter was founded in 2018 with a goal of providing 
	a fun\, safe\, and supportive environment for women to socialize and play 
	pinball together. \nBeginner and novice players of any age are encouraged 
	to join. Playing with others is a fantastic way to improve your pinball sk
	ills! For the more experienced players\, Belles & Chimes tournaments offer
	 a unique opportunity to earn IFPA points available specifically for women
	’s-only competitions.\n\nhttps://www.eurekaheights.com/event/belles-and-ch
	imes-pinball-tournament-2026-07-11/\n\nFrom Eureka Heights Brewery
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/belles-and-chimes-pinball-tournamen
	t-2026-07-11/
